        <mxCell id="prod-detail" value="cae-hotelbooking-prod-belgiumcentral-001 (Consumption, zoneRedundant: true)&#10;ca-hotelweb-prod-belgiumcentral — external — min 3 / max 10&#10;ca-hotelapi-prod-belgiumcentral — internal — min 3 / max 10&#10;sql-hotelbooking-prod-belgiumcentral-… — GP_S_Gen5 ×2, zoneRedundant: true, autoPause disabled (-1)&#10;id-hotelapi-prod-belgiumcentral-001 (runtime) = SQL Entra admin&#10;id-cicd-hotelbooking-prod-belgiumcentral-001 (CI/CD, Contributor on this RG)&#10;privatelink.database.windows.net (own zone, isolated from test's)&#10;log-hotelbooking-prod-belgiumcentral-001 (Log Analytics)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
